---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
---
<Base title="Partner disclosure" description="How Bemba earns money: partner links for eSIMs, insurance and tours, and referral fees from safari operators.">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <section class="page-head">
      <Crumbs items={[{ name: 'Partner disclosure', href: '/disclosure/' }]} />
      <h1 class="h1">How Bemba earns money.</h1>
    </section>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Bemba is free to use. We earn money in two ways, and neither changes the price you pay.</p>
      <p><b>Partner links.</b> Some links to eSIM providers, travel insurers and tour platforms are partner links, marked "Partner" on the page. If you buy through them, the partner pays us a commission.</p>
      <p><b>Safari referrals.</b> When you request safari quotes, the operator you book with pays us a referral fee.</p>
      <p>Partners never decide what we write about entry rules. Visa and health information is based on official sources only.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
